{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And the count of the quarter of Israel.</b> That is, the language of seeding, i.e., the seed destined to come forth from them. Another explanation: the language of a fourth — for he saw Israel dwelling under four banners, so he said: even a fourth portion of them I cannot count." "<b>Let my soul die the death of the upright.</b> From here is a response to the sectarians, may their name be erased — for he spoke his words by divine spirit, and he said that his end should be like that of Israel; thus you learn there is a remedy for Israel in the end."], :book :numbers, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:10:02.492286294Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}